{"path":"ranges/chunk_view/inner_iterator/operator-","title":"operator-(ranges::chunk_view::inner-iterator)","titleHtml":"operator-<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(ranges::chunk_view::<i>inner-iterator</i>)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges/chunk_view/inner_iterator/operator-","section":"ranges","kind":"page","summary":"Calculates the distance (in number of underlying elements) between the iterator and sentinel.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">friend</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> difference_type operator<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/default_sentinel_t\"><span class=\"kw2896\">std::<span class=\"me2\">default_sentinel_t</span></span></a> s,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*inner-iterator*/</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> i <span class=\"br0\">)</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; requires ranges<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">sized_sentinel_for</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iterator_t\"><span class=\"kw2909\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">sentinel_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iterator_t\"><span class=\"kw2908\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">iterator_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">friend</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> difference_type operator<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*inner-iterator*/</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> i,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/default_sentinel_t\"><span class=\"kw2896\">std::<span class=\"me2\">default_sentinel_t</span></span></a> s <span class=\"br0\">)</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; requires ranges<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">sized_sentinel_for</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iterator_t\"><span class=\"kw2909\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">sentinel_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iterator_t\"><span class=\"kw2908\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">iterator_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Calculates the distance (in number of underlying elements) between the <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/chunk_view/inner_iterator\">iterator</a> and <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/default_sentinel_t\">sentinel</a>.\n</p><p>Let <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/chunk_view/inner_iterator#Data_members\"><code><i>parent_</i></code></a> be the underlying pointer to the enclosing <code>chunk_view</code>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Equivalent to:<br><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/ranges/min\"><span class=\"kw3028\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">min</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>i.<span class=\"me1\">parent_</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>remainder_,<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/end\"><span class=\"kw2902\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">end</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>i.<span class=\"me1\">parent_</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>base_<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>i.<span class=\"me1\">parent_</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>current_<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Equivalent to: <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>s <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> i<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<p>These functions are not visible to ordinary <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/unqualified_lookup\">unqualified</a> or <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/qualified_lookup\">qualified lookup</a>, and can only be found by <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/adl\">argument-dependent lookup</a> when <code>std::ranges::chunk_view::<i>inner-iterator</i></code> is an associated class of the arguments.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> i\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/chunk_view/inner_iterator\">iterator</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> s\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the sentinel\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The distance between given iterator and sentinel.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/chunk_view/inner_iterator/operator_inc\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator++</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  increments the iterator <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/chunk_view","title":"std::ranges::views::chunk, std::ranges::chunk_view"},{"path":"ranges/chunk_view/inner_iterator","title":"std::ranges::chunk_view<V>::inner-iterator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"operator-(ranges::chunk_view::inner-iterator)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++23. Calculates the distance (in number of underlying elements) between the iterator and sentinel."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"i, s"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The distance between given iterator and sentinel."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator++","note":"increments the iterator"}]}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":131,"codeBlockCount":0}
